  "identity": "北段是1926历史工字主体较短的横条，接中间南北向短臂。采用其形状、比例、朝向、周边花园与既有南栋绑定；两支源的 OSM building=hospital 均无历史楼名，不能只按医院名称认定。此次粗估不扩充历史楼范围至同一院区其他楼。",
  "pose_method": "Select the historical perimeter, using the garden-front anchor from #39 as an additional alignment check. On z19 publish-release 2022-01-12, the north bar spans approximately 142 px horizontally and 59 px in depth, the centered link ~40 px across and 69 px in length. At this latitude ~0.255 m/px. The 2026-01-29 release matches the #39 reference scene better. In the 768×512 north-up mosaic of columns 438998–439000, rows 214242–214243, rotate clockwise 15° about its own center and crop (64,80,600,480). Choose north-wall center ~(224,157) in that crop. The same position on the 2022 release was roughly (252,151), a locus shift of ~7 m predominantly along the facade. Edges of roof and ground differ under off-nadir viewing. Numerical coordinate precision is for scene reproducibility. The national tourism text independently reports 10.5 × 18 m for the connecting volume; plan widths and photographic roof proportions guide the approximate north bar.",
  "placement_accuracy": "Scene-scale relative alignment only, metre-scale uncertainty. The 2025 source image metadata lists 8.47 m planimetric accuracy, and its visible construction/roof condition differs from earlier images. Upper roof setbacks, height and individual features are not derived from the bare source rectangle.",
  "north_entrance_orientation_review": "三开间入口突出体与北侧完整长立面方向相符。2014 Commons近楼短面在画面左、另一翼圆角塔在其后，东北往西南最能解释与两翼的关系。2014图像无GPS；不据此给每扇窗逐扇定位。",
